  "caveats": "The 10 November 2019 version of this dataset (obtained from www.gadm.org) treated the Sister Islands [KY05] as separate administrative level 1 features - Cayman Brac and Little Cayman - while distinguishing the five Grand Cayman districts the same as they are in this release. For reference the former configuration is preserved in the current “cym_admbnda_island_district” non-P-coded layer.",
